ion":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-huan-close-013","subject_person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_ACAA","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_ACA","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"第五子","birth_order":{"parent_person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_ACA","scope":"sons_of_parent","ordinal":5,"position":"unspecified","interpretation_status":"source_attested"}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-074","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-074-ws1536331","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p012","quote":"初，袁真以壽陽叛，石虔以甯遠將軍、南頓太守帥諸將攻之，克其南城。又擊苻堅將王鑒於石橋，獲馬五百匹。除竟陵太守，以父憂去職。尋而苻堅又寇淮南，詔曰：「石虔文武器幹，禦戎有方。古人絕哭，金革弗避，況在餘哀，豈得辭事！可授奮威將軍、南平太守。」尋進冠軍將軍。苻堅荊州刺史梁成、襄陽太守閻震率眾入寇竟陵，石虔與弟石民距之。賊阻敖水，屯管城。石虔設計夜渡水，既濟，賊始覺，力戰破之，進克管城，擒震，斬首七千級，俘獲萬人，馬數百匹，牛羊千頭，具裝鎧三百領。成以輕騎走保襄陽。石虔復領河東太守，進據樊城，逐堅兗州刺史張崇，納降二千家而還。沖卒，石虔以冠軍將軍監豫州揚州五郡軍事、豫州刺史。尋以母憂去職。服闋，復本位。久之，命移鎮馬頭，石虔求停曆陽，許之。","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p012:m0009"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-074","source_id":"s-jinshu-074-ws1536331","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p013","quote":"太元十三年卒，追贈右將軍。追論平閻震功，進爵作塘侯。第五子誕嗣。誕長兄洪，襄城太守。洪弟振。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p013:m0029"}],"interpretation_note":"依完整原段與具體錨點辨識；未補原文未述父母、配偶、世系或排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"context":{"kind":"adjacent_paragraphs","paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p012","c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p013"],"rationale":"石虔傳逐段承接卒及第五子誕嗣，父名見前段。","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false}},{"id":"a-huan-close-014","subject_person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_ACAB","predicate":"brother","object_person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_ACAA","status":"source_attested","quali